flowchart LR
    DEV[Development tasks and pilot evidence] --> DESIGN[Freeze policy and analysis]
    DESIGN --> SEARCH[Optimization feedback measurements]
    SEARCH --> SELECT[Freeze selected candidate]
    SELECT --> CONFIRM[Fresh confirmation observations]
    CONFIRM --> OUTPUT[Record delivered patch or defer]
    OUTPUT --> AUDIT[Protected task and workload audit]
    AUDIT --> REPORT[Report findings and uncertainty]
